    "scope": "Nothing is published as supported for NestJS. The T12 leaf is a candidate, unregistered projector over T04 facts, not a production default and not runtime-tested. supported[] lists the profile's in-scope decorator constructs together with the routes the live Nest app serves for them; the projector itself could not be run on this source (conformance BLOCKED), so registration alone does not make any construct supported.",
